'''Eternal IV''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was released on May 20th, 2020 to promote [[Murder Mystery 2|Murder Mystery 2’s]] merch. It was originally obtainable by purchasing merch from [https://shopmm2.com shopmm2.com] and redeeming the promotional code that came with it. It is now only obtainable through trading as the merch has since sold out.

==Appearance==
It has a long, slightly jagged cracked purple blade with a scratched silver edge. The guard is silver with curved quillons, two sets of horns by the ricasso, and glowing purple eyes. The handle, attached to a silver prong below the guard, is gray with a silver paracord wrap that has glowing purple beads on it.

== Trivia==
*It was leaked in a video by the YouTuber [https://youtube.com/c/JDRBX JD] a day before its release.
**The video can be found [https://youtu.be/DX1buvnnjOU here].
*It has many predecessors, those being [[Eternal]], [[Eternal II]], [[Eternal III]], and as well as the Christmas version [[Eternalcane]].
*It has been a major target in duping.
*It is the last weapon deriving from a roblox gear.
*Despite the name, it is the actually the fifth and currently the latest Eternal knife to be released as [[Eternalcane]] was released before Eternal IV.
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/532254782/Sword-of-the-Eternal-Abyss Sword of the Eternal Abyss].

